{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rose has just moved to a small town ready to start a new life. Luckily, she quickly found a job as a receptionist at the Helios Hotel, the fancy new hotel in town. Her first day proves working at the Helios Hotel isn't quite what she was expecting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Rose and perform the functions of the hotel receptionist while uncovering strange occurrences that begin to unfold more and more each night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045330/extras/Pumpkin_Guy_Small.PNG?t=1769279626\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short indie horror game broken down into chapters. There are four chapters with the full game taking around 1 hour to complete. Each chapter may take an average of 15 minutes to complete depending on how much exploration is done.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Read all pumpkin dialogue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3045330/cdd89db28e18e230be98c6fbc2717d1b4224b8df.jpg"},{"name":"Met Juancho at the bar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3045330/d7667d6f1efc461763d22990efcf40d7a0b0626c.jpg"},{"name":"Met the creeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3045330/510bfb9997f96639bedb1d2347ede7e997119614.jpg"},{"name":"Drinking on the job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3045330/de90a064175255d3dd0fc1329539b996ffa757e9.jpg"},{"name":"Hammer Smash Creep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3045330/cd18c33727e8ebbf25b13bfbbb8d3d021f3c2ef7.jpg"},{"name":"Opened room 204","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3045330/e8848a23fa7d6790fe49add2b5d59591a5593a41.jpg"},{"